      "username": "Pawpochita",
      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2025-09-23T11:29:28.147Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This is my Installation process for Raven btw.</p>\n<p>docker exec -it frappe_docker-backend-1 /bin/bash<br>\nbench get-app --branch main <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Commit-Company/raven.git\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">GitHub - The-Commit-Company/raven: Simple, open source team messaging platform</a><br>\nbench --site frontend install-app raven<br>\nbench --site frontend migrate</p>\n<p>docker exec -it frappe_docker-frontend-1 /bin/bash<br>\nbench get-app --branch main <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Commit-Company/raven.git\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">GitHub - The-Commit-Company/raven: Simple, open source team messaging platform</a><br>\nbench --site frontend migrate</p>\n<p>docker restart $(docker ps -q)</p>",
